{"id":"a05338901baa48f6","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-ideal7-closed-unbounded-dual.md","title":"ZFC Ideal7 Closed Unbounded Dual","display":"df-zfc-ideal7-closed-unbounded-dual — ZFC Ideal7 Closed Unbounded Dual","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal7-closed-unbounded-dual","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal7-closed-unbounded-dual"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal7-closed-unbounded-dual — ZFC Ideal7 Closed Unbounded Dual","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal7-closed-unbounded-dual"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal7-closed-unbounded-dual</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal7-closed-unbounded-dual — ZFC Ideal7 Closed Unbounded Dual"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\mathcal I\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\mathcal I\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> is the cardinal predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> is cofinality (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\)</span> is the club predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7ClosedUnboundedDual}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7ClosedUnboundedDual}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}closed\\text{-}unbounded\\text{-}dual} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7ClosedUnboundedDual}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land\\mathcal I=\\{A\\subseteq\\kappa:\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land A\\cap C=\\emptyset)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}closed\\text{-}unbounded\\text{-}dual} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7ClosedUnboundedDual}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land\\mathcal I=\\{A\\subseteq\\kappa:\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land A\\cap C=\\emptyset)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the nonstationary ideal on a regular uncountable cardinal, i.e. the ideal dual to the club filter.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ is the cardinal predicate (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{cf}$ is cofinality (see [[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":